    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d299">

                <pb facs="0398" n="384" sameAs="frus:frus1948v06/pg384"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BC
                    Indonesia/10–548: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Batavia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Livengood</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                        
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Batavia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-10-05T08:00:00+08:00">October 5, 1948—8
                            a. m.</date>–<date calendar="gregorian" when="1948-10-05T13:00:00+08:00"
                            >1 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>874[–879]. Gocus 402. NethDel delivered USDel 12 midnight October 4 following confidential letter dated
                    Batavia October 5 addressed Cochran.</p>
                <p>[Here follows text of letter with enclosures, quoted in telegrams 874–879,
                    October 5, Gocus 402, none printed. For text
                    as finally submitted on October 14, see SC, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">3rd yr., Suppl</hi>. (Dec), page 169. See also telegram
                    913, October 14, 10 p. m., Gocus 411, <ref
                        target="#pg418">page 418</ref>.]</p>
                <p>Signed Cochran.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Livengood</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
